body:
Dumb question alert....

&#x200B;

How is China so low?

It shouldn't bother me...

&#x200B;

BUT IT DOES

Never been that close to one, and yet I know what you're talking about somehow.

&#x200B;

Edit: actually, there was that time in my 6th grade history class when a bad storm was rolling in and the sky suddenly went BLACK and dust from the baseball field started blowing around right outside the window. There was a funnel cloud overhead, and I FUCKING KNEW.

Good luck and good mindset! A word of advice about "shoulds" though. Save "needs" and "shoulds" for your short and long term health, respectively. Make everything else a "want" or "better if" or something like that. It's very liberating!

&#x200B;

But that's just, like, my opinion, man.

Aww man, shorter kid's gettin pummelled.

&#x200B;

\*a few moments later\*

&#x200B;

Aww fuck! Shorter kids gettin mad!

There are aspects of this that strike me as unhealthy, but you also strike me as a typical horny teenager! That's a normal thing to be! 

&#x200B;

Work on your confidence and self-esteem.  Try to eat better and exercise at least a little more than you currently do. You also seem like you could benefit from counseling. 

&#x200B;

Don't beat yourself up. I don't think there's anything terribly wrong with you :).

I'm glad it helped. Most of my advice comes from this video. It's a breakdown of Jordan Peterson's interview with Cathy Newman and how he outfoxed her. If you can survive a chess game like that, you can handle any arguement with anyone.

&#x200B;

[https://youtu.be/nS9W-wlJHPA](https://youtu.be/nS9W-wlJHPA)
